@page "/compare"

@*
    Standalone paste-two-texts diff tool. The two side-by-side panes ARE the
    input: they're editable CodeMirror editors (mountCompareEditor). As you
    type or paste, source-viewer.js debounces and POSTs both texts to
    /api/compare/diff, which reuses the same DiffPlex + SideBySideDiffSerializer
    pipeline the Object Explorer compare page renders, then swaps the diff
    decorations into both panes in place (setDiff) — no remount, so typed text
    and undo history survive.

    Static SSR, no [Authorize] and no Blazor circuit: like the Object Explorer
    viewer, all interactivity lives in source-viewer.js. Works without an
    account; nothing is stored server-side. The page is just the shell —
    source-viewer.js owns the editors, the live re-diff, the summary read-out,
    and the Swap / Clear / change-navigation controls (wired by their
    data-* attributes below).
*@

<PageTitle>Compare · AL Dev Toolbox</PageTitle>

<div class="compare-page">
    <header class="admin-page__header compare-page__header">
        <div>
            <h1>Compare</h1>
            <p class="muted">
                Paste or type two versions of a text — code, a report layout,
                a configuration file — into the two panes and see the changes
                highlighted as you go. Nothing you paste is saved.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="compare-page__nav">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--outline" data-diff-nav="prev" disabled
                    title="Jump to the previous change (Ctrl+ArrowUp)">
                <Icon Name="arrow-up" Width="14" Height="14" />
                <span>Previous change</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--outline" data-diff-nav="next" disabled
                    title="Jump to the next change (Ctrl+ArrowDown)">
                <Icon Name="arrow-down" Width="14" Height="14" />
                <span>Next change</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="form-actions compare-page__actions">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--outline" data-compare-swap disabled>
            <Icon Name="arrow-left-right" Width="14" Height="14" />
            <span>Swap sides</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--outline" data-compare-clear disabled>
            <Icon Name="trash-2" Width="14" Height="14" />
            <span>Clear both</span>
        </button>
        <p class="muted compare-page__summary" data-compare-summary>
            Paste or type into either side to see what changed.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-page__pane-labels">
        <span class="section-label">Left — the original</span>
        <span class="section-label">Right — the changed version</span>
    </div>

    <div class="compare-page__panes oe-compare-file__panes">
        <div class="source-viewer source-viewer--compare" data-pane="left">
            <div class="source-viewer__code"
                 data-language="text"
                 data-editable="true"
                 data-content=""
                 data-placeholder="Paste the original version here"
                 spellcheck="false"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="source-viewer source-viewer--compare" data-pane="right">
            <div class="source-viewer__code"
                 data-language="text"
                 data-editable="true"
                 data-content=""
                 data-placeholder="Paste the changed version here"
                 spellcheck="false"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
